                                            "A kind of lightweight thread of execution."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd2017d0-104b-4429-a0c9-c77d74a64741",
                                                "sense_id": "ed0d7ccc-c13f-3f5f-b8d8-445e8ee7a12c",
                                                "text": "We've seen how to create a new fiber and convert the current thread into a fiber (which continues to run after the conversion), but we have yet to focus on how to schedule a new fiber onto the current thread."
